---
import AppLayout from "../layouts/AppLayout.astro";
import { companyName, primaryCtaLabel, siteTagline } from "../lib/site";
---

<AppLayout title="AI customer conversations that get work done">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50">
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3"><img src="/favicon.ico" alt="" class="h-9 w-9 rounded-md" /><span class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-950">{companyName}</span></a><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/login" class="px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600">Sign in</a><a href="/register" class="rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-700">Start free</a></div></div></header>
    <main>
      <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
        <div><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-700">{siteTagline}</p><h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">Turn every customer message into the next best action.</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">Build reliable AI assistants for support, sales, bookings, and service—grounded in your knowledge and available on web, Telegram, and WhatsApp.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><a href="/register" class="rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-700">{primaryCtaLabel}</a><a href="/pricing" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100">View pricing</a></div><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Start free. No credit card required.</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-950 p-7 text-white shadow-xl"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-300">One workspace</p><div class="mt-5 space-y-4"><div class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 p-4"><p class="font-semibold">Design the journey</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300">Guide conversations with visual flows and clear handoffs.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 p-4"><p class="font-semibold">Answer from trusted knowledge</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300">Keep responses useful, consistent, and grounded.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 p-4"><p class="font-semibold">Launch when you are ready</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300">Test each channel, then activate it for customers.</p></div></div></div>
      </section>
      <section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-700">Built for outcomes</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-950">Everything you need to run better customer conversations.</h2></div><div class="mt-9 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">Build without guesswork</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Shape guided flows, connect approved knowledge, and preview the experience before launch.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">Reach customers anywhere</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Use the same service across web chat, Telegram, and WhatsApp without rebuilding the logic.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">Improve with evidence</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Review conversations, usage, and outcomes so your team knows what to improve next.</p></article></div></div></section>
      <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr]"><div><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-700">Simple by design</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-950">From idea to live assistant in three steps.</h2></div><ol class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"><li class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="font-bold text-blue-700">01</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-slate-950">Create a service</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Choose its purpose and behavior.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="font-bold text-blue-700">02</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-slate-950">Add knowledge</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Ground answers in content you trust.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="font-bold text-blue-700">03</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-slate-950">Test and activate</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Verify each channel before customers use it.</p></li></ol></div></section>
      <section class="bg-blue-600"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 px-4 py-12 text-white sm:px-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:px-8"><div><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Ready to make every conversation count?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-blue-100">Create your first AI customer service today.</p></div><a href="/register" class="rounded-lg bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-50">Start free</a></div></section>
    </main>
  </div>
</AppLayout>
